lass=\"keyword\">val</span> with_timeout : <span>float <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>(<span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>with_timeout tm f</code> calls <code>f ()</code> with a timeout of <code>tm</code>, and unsets the timeout once the call to <code>f ()</code> completes or raises an exception.</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"raises\"><span class=\"at-tag\">raises</span> <a href=\"../../Util/index.html#exception-Timeout\"><code>Util.Timeout</code></a> <p>if the timeout is reached before <code>f ()</code> completes.</p></li></ul></div></div>"}